vate an item; **Escape**: close"],[1192,"**Space/Enter**: Select the focused segment"],[594,"**Sprite Sheet Creation**: A hidden SVG sprite sheet is automatically injected into the DOM containing symbol definitions"],[604,"**SSR Limitation**: Sprite references render empty until client-side hydration"],[1283,"**Standalone** - with no parent context it renders with its own structural defaults and looks the same everywhere."],[835,"**Steppers**: A stepper is a `Group` holding `Button slot=\"decrement\"`, an `Input`, and `Button slot=\"increment\"`. Left empty, each button takes its icon and `variant=\"control\"` from the field, so no icon imports are needed. Compose a bare `Input` instead for a plain numeric input"],[1750,"**Sticky axes**: Positioned absolutely to remain visible during scroll"],[1739,"**Sticky y-axis**: The y-axis remains visible during horizontal scroll"],[544,"**Styling**: `className`, `style`, `data-*` attributes"],[588,"**SVG Parsing**: The fetched SVG string is parsed into a React element using `@bento/svg-parser`"],[1580,"**Tab**"],[244,"**Tab**: Moves focus to the next/previous checkbox"],[1064,"**Tab**: Moves focus to/from the radio group"],[1190,"**Tab**: Moves focus to/from the segmented controller"],[1520,"**The body is `<Text slot=\"body\">`**, once or as many times as the copy needs."],[1518,"**The eyebrow is `slot=\"eyebrow\"`**, on either a `Text` or a `Tag`. The two forms swap\nfreely, and a `Tag` is sized to pair with the lockup."],[1519,"**The title is `<Heading slot=\"title\">`.** Pick the level from the document outline, not the\nvisual size: `size` handles the visuals, so `level={1}` in an `xs` lockup is perfectly valid."],[1019,"**Titles overflow:** that's expected — titles truncate. Shorten the title."],[1576,"**ToggleButton Item:** `data-selected`, `data-hovered`, `data-pressed`, `data-focus-visible`, `data-disabled`"],[1575,"**ToggleButtonGroup Container:** `data-size`"],[1754,"**Tooltips** use absolute positioning and scroll-