nd disabled state"],[1252,"**Validation states**: Use `isInvalid` with a `FieldError` and `isDisabled` for validation and disabled state"],[1633,"**Validation states**: Use `isInvalid` with a `FieldError` and `isDisabled` for validation and disabled state"],[837,"**Value scale**: `minValue`, `maxValue`, `step`, and `formatOptions` configure the numeric behavior"],[1772,"**Verify event targets**: Tooltips use mouse event coordinates and bar group positions"],[1709,"**Vertical and horizontal orientations**: Choose the best layout for your data and use case"],[1748,"**Vertical charts**: Horizontal scrolling when many data points exceed container width"],[1718,"**VisX integration**: Leverages VisX primitives for scales, axes, shapes, and responsive layout"],[593,"**What happens with sprite mode:**"],[1384,"`--color-input-background-default`"],[1381,"`--color-input-background-selected`"],[1390,"`--color-input-text-default`"],[1391,"`--ux-1glcx6s`"],[1379,"`--ux-1m9ys0v`"],[1385,"`--ux-1nu8itt`"],[1388,"`--ux-1sbfig8`"],[1382,"`--ux-sywk25`"],[1394,"`--ux-zvaw3s`"],[154,"`@godaddy/antares/date` re-exports `@internationalized/date`, the package behind these date primitives."],[1973,"`<Box blockAlignChildren=\"center\">`"],[1975,"`<Box inlineAlignChildren=\"center\">`"],[1969,"`<Box orientation=\"horizontal\">`"],[1971,"`<Box orientation=\"vertical\">`"],[1976,"`<Flex alignItems=\"center\">`"],[1972,"`<Flex direction=\"column\" >`"],[1970,"`<Flex direction=\"row\" >`"],[1974,"`<Flex justifyContent=\"center\">`"],[1926,"`2xl` - 2x extra large spacing"],[731,"`acceptedFileTypes` is a best-effort filter for the OS picker — always validate file type and size again in your `onSelect` handler, since it can be bypassed."],[1513,"`align` centers the parts as well as the text, so a `Tag` eyebrow stays centered too."],[1070,"`aria-checked` indicates selection state"],[1195,"`aria-checked` indicates selection state"],[288,"`aria-describedby` wires the `helperText` to the progressbar f